{
  "title": "晴天改道",
  "dialogue": [
    {
      "line_id": "L001",
      "speaker": "female",
      "ja": "今日は電車に乗らないんです。",
      "zh_CN": "今天我不坐电车。",
      "emotion": "natural",
      "subtext": "restrained",
      "start": 2.4,
      "end": 7.2,
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "shot_id": "S01",
      "meaning_check": "pending_human_review"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "L002",
      "speaker": "male",
      "ja": "そうなんですか。",
      "zh_CN": "这样啊。",
      "emotion": "natural",
      "subtext": "restrained",
      "start": 14.4,
      "end": 19.2,
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "shot_id": "S02",
      "meaning_check": "pending_human_review"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "L003",
      "speaker": "female",
      "ja": "川沿いを歩いて帰ろうと思って。",
      "zh_CN": "我想沿河走回去。",
      "emotion": "natural",
      "subtext": "restrained",
      "start": 26.4,
      "end": 31.2,
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "shot_id": "S03",
      "meaning_check": "pending_human_review"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "L004",
      "speaker": "male",
      "ja": "遠回りですね。",
      "zh_CN": "那要绕远路了。",
      "emotion": "natural",
      "subtext": "restrained",
      "start": 38.4,
      "end": 43.2,
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "shot_id": "S04",
      "meaning_check": "pending_human_review"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "L005",
      "speaker": "female",
      "ja": "晴れた日くらいは。",
      "zh_CN": "难得天晴嘛。",
      "emotion": "natural",
      "subtext": "restrained",
      "start": 50.4,
      "end": 55.2,
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "shot_id": "S05",
      "meaning_check": "pending_human_review"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "L006",
      "speaker": "male",
      "ja": "もしよければ、途中まで。",
      "zh_CN": "如果方便，我陪你走一段。",
      "emotion": "natural",
      "subtext": "restrained",
      "start": 62.4,
      "end": 67.2,
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "shot_id": "S06",
      "meaning_check": "pending_human_review"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "L007",
      "speaker": "female",
      "ja": "いいですよ。急いでないので。",
      "zh_CN": "好啊，我也不赶时间。",
      "emotion": "natural",
      "subtext": "restrained",
      "start": 74.4,
      "end": 79.2,
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "shot_id": "S07",
      "meaning_check": "pending_human_review"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "L008",
      "speaker": "male",
      "ja": "あの橋、夕方はきれいです。",
      "zh_CN": "那座桥傍晚很好看。",
      "emotion": "natural",
      "subtext": "restrained",
      "start": 86.4,
      "end": 91.2,
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "shot_id": "S08",
      "meaning_check": "pending_human_review"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "L009",
      "speaker": "female",
      "ja": "じゃあ、橋まで案内してください。",
      "zh_CN": "那就带我走到桥边吧。",
      "emotion": "natural",
      "subtext": "restrained",
      "start": 98.4,
      "end": 103.2,
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "shot_id": "S09",
      "meaning_check": "pending_human_review"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "L010",
      "speaker": "male",
      "ja": "はい。今日は傘、いらないですね。",
      "zh_CN": "好。今天用不上伞了。",
      "emotion": "natural",
      "subtext": "restrained",
      "start": 110.4,
      "end": 115.2,
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "shot_id": "S10",
      "meaning_check": "pending_human_review"
    }
  ],
